<header id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker rv"><i>◆</i> OPEN SOURCE · COLUMNAR OLAP · BUILT FOR DATA ENGINEERS</p>
    <h1 class="rv" style="transition-delay:.08s">Data, set in <em>stone.</em></h1>
    <p class="sub rv" style="transition-delay:.16s">
      Basalt is an open-source analytical database that thinks in columns.
      One static binary, Postgres wire-compatible, append-only to the core —
      and fast enough to make your warehouse nervous.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row rv" style="transition-delay:.24s">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#community">Get started</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#engine">Read the docs →</a>
